          <type><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_machine_basic_block_1ae34c996b58df9b9ce6695a0c8b70c533" kindref="member">MachineBasicBlock::iterator</ref> &amp;</type>
          <declname>NextMBBI</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Lower a HOM_Prolog pseudo instruction into a helper call or a sequence of homogeneous stores. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Lower a HOM_Prolog pseudo instruction into a helper call while creating the helper on demand.</para>
<para>When a fp setup follows, it can be optimized.</para>
<para>Or emit a sequence of stores in place when not using a helper call.</para>
<para><orderedlist>
<listitem><para>With a helper including frame-setup HOM_Prolog x30, x29, x19, x20, x21, x22, 32 =&gt; stp x29, x30, [sp, #-16]! bl _OUTLINED_FUNCTION_PROLOG_FRAME32_x30x29x19x20x21x22</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>With a helper HOM_Prolog x30, x29, x19, x20, x21, x22 =&gt; stp x29, x30, [sp, #-16]! bl _OUTLINED_FUNCTION_PROLOG_x30x29x19x20x21x22</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Without a helper HOM_Prolog x30, x29, x19, x20, x21, x22 =&gt; stp x22, x21, [sp, #-48]! stp x20, x19, [sp, #16] stp x29, x30, [sp, #32] </para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
