        <briefdescription>
<para>Lower a HOM_Epilog pseudo instruction into a helper call or a sequence of homogeneous loads. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Lower a HOM_Epilog pseudo instruction into a helper call while creating the helper on demand.</para>
<para>When a return follow, it can be optimized.</para>
<para>Or emit a sequence of loads in place when not using a helper call.</para>
<para><orderedlist>
<listitem><para>With a helper including ret HOM_Epilog x30, x29, x19, x20, x21, x22 ; MBBI ret ; NextMBBI =&gt; b _OUTLINED_FUNCTION_EPILOG_TAIL_x30x29x19x20x21x22 ... ; NextMBBI</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>With a helper HOM_Epilog x30, x29, x19, x20, x21, x22 =&gt; bl _OUTLINED_FUNCTION_EPILOG_x30x29x19x20x21x22</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Without a helper HOM_Epilog x30, x29, x19, x20, x21, x22 =&gt; ldp x29, x30, [sp, #32] ldp x20, x19, [sp, #16] ldp x22, x21, [sp], #48 </para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
